  </style>

  <!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
  <section class="hero" id="top">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow rv"><span class="dot"></span>Hybrid and EV guide, Birmingham</span>
      <h1 class="rv rv-d1">
        Hybrid or EV will not start? It is usually the <span class="hl">small 12V battery</span>, not the big one.
      </h1>
      <p class="blog-meta rv rv-d1"><time datetime="2026-10-14">14 October 2026</time> &middot; Birmingham Jump Start</p>
      <p class="sub rv rv-d2">
        Your dashboard says the main battery is full, yet the car will not unlock, will not wake up and will not go into Ready mode. That confusing fault catches out hybrid and electric car drivers across Birmingham every week. This guide explains why it happens, where the 12V battery hides, and how a professional boost gets you moving safely.
      </p>
